# Saheb Paper Pvt. Ltd. — ERP System Project Overview

## Executive Summary
The Saheb Paper ERP system is a comprehensive solution for managing paper manufacturing operations from raw material procurement to final dispatch. The system provides real-time visibility, data accuracy, and operational efficiency across the entire production lifecycle.

## Key Modules

### 1. Authentication & Security
- Role‑based access control
- Session‑based secure login
- Adaptive dashboard based on user role

### 2. Admin Master Data Management
- **Products** – Define paper specifications (GSM, weight, size)
- **Parties** – Manage customers and business partners
- **Vendors** – Track raw‑material suppliers
- **Vehicles** – Manage the logistics fleet
- **Raw Materials** – Inventory tracking and management
- **User Management** – Control staff access and permissions

### 3. Raw Material Workflow
- Inward material entry from vendors
- Real‑time stock level monitoring
- Minimum‑stock threshold alerts
- Automatic stock deduction during production

### 4. Production Pipeline
- **Pulp Mill** – Track waste mix and chemical dosage
- **Paper Machine** – Monitor parent roll production (weight, GSM)
- **Rewinder** – Split parent rolls into finished reels (size, ply, weight, diameter)

### 5. Quality Control
- Physical testing (GSM, brightness, softness)
- Product grading (Grade A, Grade B, Fail)
- Automatic status updates based on inspection results

### 6. Dispatch & Challan
- Order fulfillment from finished stock
- Professional packing slip and challan generation
- Vehicle and driver assignment
- Delivery status tracking (Dispatched, Delivered, Returned)

### 7. Utilities Monitoring
- **Boiler** – Log wood consumption, pressure, temperature
- **ETP** – Track liquid usage
- **Electricity** – Monitor power consumption in kWh

### 8. Digital Traceability
- QR code integration for each artwork
- Instant history lookup showing the complete production journey
- Full supply‑chain visibility from raw material to delivery

## User Roles
- **Admin** – Full system access and reporting
- **Production Staff** – Mill, machine, and rewinder operations
- **QC Inspectors** – Testing and grading workflow
- **Warehouse/Dispatch** – Order fulfillment and logistics
- **Utility Operators** – Resource usage logging

This document provides a professional overview that can be shared with clients to demonstrate the system’s capabilities and business value.